1
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:04,737
On July 8th,

2
00:00:04,787 --> 00:00:05,691
2014,

3
00:00:05,741 --> 00:00:07,599
in Belo Horizonte,

4
00:00:07,649 --> 00:00:14,202
Germany need just twenty-nine minutes to score
five goals against Brazil, at home,

5
00:00:14,252 --> 00:00:16,697
in a World Cup semi-final.

6
00:00:17,047 --> 00:00:18,053
For years,

7
00:00:18,103 --> 00:00:20,692
that match is treated as rock bottom,

8
00:00:20,742 --> 00:00:24,973
the kind of humiliation that happens
once in a lifetime and that,

9
00:00:25,023 --> 00:00:27,260
precisely because it is so big,

10
00:00:27,310 --> 00:00:30,250
should force Brazilian
football to rebuild.

11
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:31,893
The logic is simple:

12
00:00:31,943 --> 00:00:34,473
after seven-one, the only way is up.

13
00:00:34,823 --> 00:00:36,163
Twelve years later,

14
00:00:36,213 --> 00:00:38,480
the problem is no longer a scoreline.

15
00:00:38,530 --> 00:00:43,063
It is that Brazilian fans have stopped
expecting anything from their own national

16
00:00:43,113 --> 00:00:43,733
team.

17
00:00:44,083 --> 00:00:45,699
In December 2024,

18
00:00:45,749 --> 00:00:46,765
in Doha,

19
00:00:46,815 --> 00:00:51,430
Vinícius Júnior is named the best
player in the world by FIFA,

20
00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:53,962
ahead of Rodri and Bellingham,

21
00:00:54,012 --> 00:00:57,761
the first Brazilian to win it
since Kaká in 2007,

22
00:00:57,811 --> 00:01:03,492
and for one night it looks like Brazil have
finally found the heir to Romário,

23
00:01:03,542 --> 00:01:05,558
Ronaldo and Ronaldinho.

24
00:01:05,908 --> 00:01:08,098
Less than two years later,

25
00:01:08,148 --> 00:01:13,303
that same player is whistled by Real
Madrid's own fans at the Bernabéu.

26
00:01:13,653 --> 00:01:15,678
And the numbers explain why.

27
00:01:15,728 --> 00:01:18,388
In his first eight matches this season,

28
00:01:18,438 --> 00:01:20,176
he has scored one goal,

29
00:01:20,226 --> 00:01:23,924
his worst start since he became a
starter at Real Madrid.

30
00:01:23,974 --> 00:01:29,113
The club spends more than a hundred million
euros on a nineteen-year-old who plays

31
00:01:29,163 --> 00:01:30,497
in his position,

32
00:01:30,547 --> 00:01:34,591
and when the newspaper Marca asks
its readers who should start,

33
00:01:34,641 --> 00:01:37,185
more than fifty thousand people vote,

34
00:01:37,235 --> 00:01:40,587
and eighty-six percent of them
choose the teenager.

35
00:01:40,937 --> 00:01:41,939
With Brazil,

36
00:01:41,989 --> 00:01:43,411
it is the same film.

37
00:01:43,461 --> 00:01:44,568
Against India,

38
00:01:44,618 --> 00:01:49,352
a team that has never played at a World Cup
and sits more than a hundred and thirty

39
00:01:49,402 --> 00:01:53,191
places below Brazil in the ranking,
he is taken off at half-time.

40
00:01:53,541 --> 00:01:54,755
And in Brazil,

41
00:01:54,805 --> 00:01:56,422
he has become a joke.

42
00:01:56,472 --> 00:02:00,159
When he has a cosmetic procedure
on his chin this summer,

43
00:02:00,209 --> 00:02:04,010
the internet finds the perfect
explanation for his decline:

44
00:02:04,060 --> 00:02:06,884
the real Vini died on the operating table,

45
00:02:06,934 --> 00:02:10,103
and the man on the pitch
today is a body double.

46
00:02:10,153 --> 00:02:12,172
Because for a lot of people,

47
00:02:12,222 --> 00:02:17,116
that is the only way to explain how the best
player in the world got this bad,

48
00:02:17,166 --> 00:02:18,150
this fast.

49
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:19,664
Off the pitch,

50
00:02:19,714 --> 00:02:21,816
he has never been more visible:

51
00:02:21,866 --> 00:02:22,864
a new face,

52
00:02:22,914 --> 00:02:24,409
a famous girlfriend,

53
00:02:24,459 --> 00:02:27,223
millions of followers
watching every photo.

54
00:02:27,273 --> 00:02:30,258
On the pitch, he has never
looked further away.

55
00:02:30,608 --> 00:02:34,737
And when you watch him in a yellow shirt,
you understand why the joke stuck.

56
00:02:43,087 --> 00:02:45,924
It does not look like a
player in bad form.

57
00:02:45,974 --> 00:02:49,320
It looks like someone who does
not want to be there.

58
00:02:49,370 --> 00:02:52,037
And that is exactly what hurts the fans,

59
00:02:52,087 --> 00:02:56,904
because they remember a time when the best
player in the world wore yellow and

60
00:02:56,954 --> 00:03:01,036
played as if that shirt was the most
important thing in his life.

61
00:03:01,386 --> 00:03:05,977
So the question is no longer whether
Brazil will win the next World Cup.

62
00:03:06,027 --> 00:03:07,079
It is what,

63
00:03:07,129 --> 00:03:08,007
exactly,

64
00:03:08,057 --> 00:03:10,792
happened to the Brazilian national team.

65
00:03:15,742 --> 00:03:16,987
Before we go on:

66
00:03:17,037 --> 00:03:19,092
if you like this kind of story,

67
00:03:19,142 --> 00:03:20,226
leave a like,

68
00:03:20,276 --> 00:03:21,197
subscribe,

69
00:03:21,247 --> 00:03:24,921
and send this video to a friend who
still believes in Brazil.

70
00:03:24,971 --> 00:03:27,134
It really helps the channel grow.

71
00:03:27,484 --> 00:03:28,926
To understand it,

72
00:03:28,976 --> 00:03:30,776
start with the captain.

73
00:03:30,826 --> 00:03:32,089
In March 2025,

74
00:03:32,139 --> 00:03:35,252
days before facing
Argentina in Buenos Aires,

75
00:03:35,302 --> 00:03:39,012
Raphinha gives an interview to
Romário and promises to,

76
00:03:39,062 --> 00:03:39,847
quote,

77
00:03:39,897 --> 00:03:43,368
beat them up, on the pitch and
off it if necessary.

78
00:03:43,718 --> 00:03:46,289
Argentina answer by winning four-one,

79
00:03:46,339 --> 00:03:51,531
and after the final whistle their players are
filmed singing a chant aimed at him.

80
00:03:51,881 --> 00:03:53,228
Three months later,

81
00:03:53,278 --> 00:03:54,624
already on holiday,

82
00:03:54,674 --> 00:03:58,917
Raphinha talks about the Club World Cup
and says it is hard to give up your

83
00:03:58,967 --> 00:03:59,796
holidays,

84
00:03:59,846 --> 00:04:02,176
and that not everyone will want to go.

85
00:04:10,126 --> 00:04:11,771
He is talking about clubs,

86
00:04:11,821 --> 00:04:12,719
not Brazil,

87
00:04:12,769 --> 00:04:13,567
but Zico,

88
00:04:13,617 --> 00:04:17,207
one of the greatest players in the
history of Brazilian football,

89
00:04:17,257 --> 00:04:18,853
criticises him in public.

90
00:04:30,203 --> 00:04:31,776
And in November 2026,

91
00:04:31,826 --> 00:04:34,742
before a trip to Asia with
the national team,

92
00:04:34,792 --> 00:04:38,323
the captain says that if
Ancelotti really counts on him,

93
00:04:38,373 --> 00:04:40,897
he knows he has to manage his minutes.

94
00:04:40,947 --> 00:04:43,695
He has had three injuries in eight months,

95
00:04:43,745 --> 00:04:46,381
but in Brazil nobody hears the injuries.

96
00:04:46,431 --> 00:04:50,970
What they hear is a player choosing which
matches to play for his country.

97
00:04:51,020 --> 00:04:53,041
At the next press conference,

98
00:04:53,091 --> 00:04:56,119
when he tries to explain
himself, this happens.

99
00:05:07,469 --> 00:05:10,825
Twenty-four seconds without
finishing the sentence.

100
00:05:10,875 --> 00:05:11,921
Days later,

101
00:05:11,971 --> 00:05:15,674
he walks out against Japan
wearing the captain's armband,

102
00:05:15,724 --> 00:05:17,868
and he leaves with a red card.

103
00:05:18,218 --> 00:05:23,133
Bruno Guimarães is a different story
that ends in the same place.

104
00:05:23,183 --> 00:05:26,807
In the round of sixteen of
the 2026 World Cup,

105
00:05:26,857 --> 00:05:28,371
against Norway,

106
00:05:28,421 --> 00:05:30,344
Brazil win a penalty,

107
00:05:30,394 --> 00:05:34,697
and with the 2024 world player of
the year on the pitch,

108
00:05:34,747 --> 00:05:37,555
Ancelotti gives the ball to Bruno.

109
00:05:37,605 --> 00:05:38,779
He misses,

110
00:05:38,829 --> 00:05:40,275
Brazil go out,

111
00:05:40,325 --> 00:05:44,969
and two days later the midfielder
writes that it hurts a lot.

112
00:05:45,319 --> 00:05:46,442
And Vinícius,

113
00:05:46,492 --> 00:05:48,563
who did not take that penalty,

114
00:05:48,613 --> 00:05:51,466
finally scores twice for
Brazil in November,

115
00:05:51,516 --> 00:05:52,694
against Japan,

116
00:05:52,744 --> 00:05:54,927
one of them into the top corner.

117
00:05:54,977 --> 00:05:57,886
Brazil still lose three-two
in stoppage time,

118
00:05:57,936 --> 00:06:01,961
for the second time in thirteen
months against the same opponent.

119
00:06:14,611 --> 00:06:19,944
And if anyone in Brazil thought the
humiliation would stay in the family,

120
00:06:19,994 --> 00:06:22,535
Argentina made sure it did not.

121
00:06:22,585 --> 00:06:23,599
In 2022,

122
00:06:23,649 --> 00:06:26,124
when Brazil go out to Croatia,

123
00:06:26,174 --> 00:06:29,712
Argentina's fans celebrate
inside the stadium.

124
00:06:29,762 --> 00:06:31,107
A year later,

125
00:06:31,157 --> 00:06:37,088
Argentina win at the Maracanã and hand Brazil
the first home defeat in the history

126
00:06:37,138 --> 00:06:39,613
of their World Cup qualifiers.

127
00:06:39,963 --> 00:06:44,302
The comparison with the past
becomes impossible to avoid.

128
00:06:44,352 --> 00:06:45,383
In 1994,

129
00:06:45,433 --> 00:06:48,894
Dunga lifts the trophy
screaming at the sky,

130
00:06:48,944 --> 00:06:52,946
and in 2002 Cafu climbs onto
the podium in Yokohama,

131
00:06:52,996 --> 00:06:54,769
with a shaved head,

132
00:06:54,819 --> 00:06:58,956
no cameras in the dressing room
and no skincare brand.

133
00:06:59,306 --> 00:07:02,075
Today's Brazil have tattoos on every arm,

134
00:07:02,125 --> 00:07:06,964
a hairdresser before every tournament and
more followers than any team on the

135
00:07:07,014 --> 00:07:07,826
planet,

136
00:07:07,876 --> 00:07:11,508
and it is tempting to conclude
that this is the problem.

137
00:07:11,858 --> 00:07:13,637
Except that in 2002,

138
00:07:13,687 --> 00:07:18,864
Ronaldo walks out with the most
ridiculous haircut in World Cup history,

139
00:07:18,914 --> 00:07:21,739
a triangle of hair on a shaved head,

140
00:07:21,789 --> 00:07:24,157
and still scores eight goals,

141
00:07:24,207 --> 00:07:26,313
two of them in the final.

142
00:07:26,363 --> 00:07:29,058
So the problem was never the hair.

143
00:07:29,108 --> 00:07:30,234
Back then,

144
00:07:30,284 --> 00:07:32,521
fame came after the trophy.

145
00:07:32,571 --> 00:07:36,310
Today it comes first, and
sometimes instead of it.

146
00:07:36,660 --> 00:07:40,603
And it is worth remembering
what is at stake.

147
00:07:40,653 --> 00:07:44,897
This is the shirt Pelé wore
at seventeen in 1958,

148
00:07:44,947 --> 00:07:48,061
the one Garrincha carried in 1962,

149
00:07:48,111 --> 00:07:53,410
the one that became the most
beautiful team in history in 1970,

150
00:07:53,460 --> 00:07:56,423
the one Romário rescued in 1994,

151
00:07:56,473 --> 00:07:58,533
and the one Ronaldo,

152
00:07:58,583 --> 00:08:03,128
Rivaldo and Ronaldinho took to
a fifth title in 2002.

153
00:08:03,178 --> 00:08:04,559
Five stars,

154
00:08:04,609 --> 00:08:08,401
and no other country in
the world has five.

155
00:08:08,751 --> 00:08:11,680
What changed is the road that leads to it.

156
00:08:11,730 --> 00:08:15,790
Brazil now export more footballers
than any country on Earth,

157
00:08:15,840 --> 00:08:20,079
one thousand four hundred and
fifty-five of them playing abroad.

158
00:08:20,129 --> 00:08:23,058
Vinícius signs for Real Madrid at sixteen,

159
00:08:23,108 --> 00:08:24,487
so does Endrick,

160
00:08:24,537 --> 00:08:26,811
and both grow up far from home,

161
00:08:26,861 --> 00:08:28,240
becoming brands,

162
00:08:28,290 --> 00:08:30,563
with sponsors and social media,

163
00:08:30,613 --> 00:08:33,780
before they become idols in
their own country.

164
00:08:33,830 --> 00:08:37,056
And the person who confirms
it is not a critic.

165
00:08:37,106 --> 00:08:39,082
It is the captain himself.

166
00:08:56,632 --> 00:08:57,528
In 2024,

167
00:08:57,578 --> 00:09:01,492
Ronaldinho had already said what
many people were thinking:

168
00:09:01,542 --> 00:09:04,155
that there was no love for the shirt,

169
00:09:04,205 --> 00:09:05,397
no fight and,

170
00:09:05,447 --> 00:09:06,462
above all,

171
00:09:06,512 --> 00:09:07,646
no football.

172
00:09:07,696 --> 00:09:08,770
Days later,

173
00:09:08,820 --> 00:09:12,615
he revealed the line was part of
an advertising campaign.

174
00:09:12,665 --> 00:09:16,461
The strange part is that almost
nobody disagreed with it.

175
00:09:16,811 --> 00:09:18,725
Through all of this,

176
00:09:18,775 --> 00:09:23,917
the national team spent twelve years
depending on a single player.

177
00:09:23,967 --> 00:09:25,039
In 2014,

178
00:09:25,089 --> 00:09:28,828
Neymar gets injured and the
seven-one follows.

179
00:09:28,878 --> 00:09:29,950
In 2022,

180
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:34,089
he scores against Croatia and
Brazil go out anyway.

181
00:09:34,139 --> 00:09:35,493
And in 2026,

182
00:09:35,543 --> 00:09:37,106
against Norway,

183
00:09:37,156 --> 00:09:42,648
Brazil leave in the round of sixteen,
their worst World Cup since 1990.

184
00:09:53,698 --> 00:09:54,849
After Japan,

185
00:09:54,899 --> 00:09:55,809
Romário,

186
00:09:55,859 --> 00:09:57,790
a world champion in 1994,

187
00:09:57,840 --> 00:10:00,912
sums up the mood of the
country in one line:

188
00:10:00,962 --> 00:10:01,992
Ancelotti,

189
00:10:02,042 --> 00:10:03,313
that's enough.

190
00:10:03,363 --> 00:10:05,534
Pack your things and get out.

191
00:10:05,884 --> 00:10:08,305
The next World Cup is in 2030,

192
00:10:08,355 --> 00:10:09,411
in Spain,

193
00:10:09,461 --> 00:10:11,296
Portugal and Morocco.

194
00:10:11,346 --> 00:10:13,377
If Brazil do not win it,

195
00:10:13,427 --> 00:10:17,019
that will be twenty-eight
years without a title,

196
00:10:17,069 --> 00:10:20,725
and Ancelotti's contract runs
exactly until then.

197
00:10:20,775 --> 00:10:23,651
When he is asked about the criticism,

198
00:10:23,701 --> 00:10:25,472
his answer is short:

199
00:10:25,522 --> 00:10:27,098
we have a future.

200
00:10:27,448 --> 00:10:28,717
Maybe they do.

201
00:10:28,767 --> 00:10:29,677
In 2030,

202
00:10:29,727 --> 00:10:32,615
Endrick and Estêvão will be twenty-three,

203
00:10:32,665 --> 00:10:34,894
and Vinícius will turn thirty.

204
00:10:34,944 --> 00:10:37,952
But for the first time in
a very long time,

205
00:10:38,002 --> 00:10:42,810
Brazil will arrive at a World Cup without
anyone calling them favourites.

206
00:10:43,160 --> 00:10:46,090
The seven-one was supposed
to be rock bottom.

207
00:10:46,140 --> 00:10:47,608
Twelve years later,

208
00:10:47,658 --> 00:10:50,251
the best player in the world is a meme,

209
00:10:50,301 --> 00:10:52,443
the captain is asking for rest,

210
00:10:52,493 --> 00:10:54,861
and Japan have beaten Brazil twice.

211
00:10:54,911 --> 00:10:58,909
Maybe the internet's joke is closer
to the truth than it sounds,

212
00:10:58,959 --> 00:11:02,170
and something really did die
after that World Cup.

213
00:11:02,220 --> 00:11:06,725
The question is whether there is still
time to bring it back before 2030.
